<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Ivory cocoa product exports change little August.</title>
<headline>Ivory cocoa product exports change little August.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast exported 5,792 tonnes of semi-finished cocoa products in August against 5,805 tonnes in July, official data show.</p>
<p>Exports in August 1995 amounted to 3,643 tonnes.</p>
<p>Cumulative exports in the first 11 months of the 1995/96 (Oct-Sept) season were 56,855 tonnes against 45,856 tonnes in the same period of 1994/95.</p>
<p>The data do not separate liquor, butter and cake exports but they show additional shipments of 239 tonnes of powder.</p>
<p>Cumulative powder shipments stand at 4,515 tonnes this season against 63 tonnes last year.</p>
<p>--Matthew Bunce, Abidjan Newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
